{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《驅魔速遞》一眾演員戲裡戲外感情極佳！於劇中擔正男主角的周嘉洛在今日（7日）喜迎 31 歲生日，日前他獲「三太」樊亦敏及一眾《驅魔速遞》劇組好友齊齊現身為他開心慶生。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1814f03e-a1a4-44f5-96f6-61db0168a4a5.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qOVd9Q1Iqb1791364161.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1814f03e-a1a4-44f5-96f6-61db0168a4a5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ae906a05-2047-4d51-9b75-f23dd2bdf28f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026OBGeeZqnd71791364160.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ae906a05-2047-4d51-9b75-f23dd2bdf28f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">樊亦敏在社交平台開心分享了精心剪輯的慶生短片與合照，可見二人互動既溫馨又惹笑。劇組對這位「壽星仔」可謂極具心思，特別準備了一個精緻的特製蛋糕，上面不僅印有幾位演員的合照，更搞笑寫上「港版 RYAN GOSLING 生日快樂」的祝福字句，儀式感與幽默感同時爆燈！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在慶生短片中，周嘉洛更反客為主，大唱生日歌向樊亦敏送上祝福，期間更語出驚人地向對方許下超幽默的「15 億約定」：「祝你好快有 15 億，跟住買房！」隨後又爆笑補充：「一瞓醒擘大眼，又賺一億啦，嘩，正啊！」場面極度歡樂。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8f3f9dff-84fa-494f-b05f-7822f805d6a5.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026yODZF0m3H71791364162.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8f3f9dff-84fa-494f-b05f-7822f805d6a5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T09:39:05.724849+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}